    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there's help... but what's the point? the help doesn't change the fact that i'm just living in a waiting room for death. every day is just the same cycle of watching him fade and feeling myself fade too. it's like i'm already gone, just stuck in this body until it's finally over.",
