      "content": "sometimes i look at him and then i look at the pills or the car or just the window, and i think... if i could just find some peace, like he must have once, wouldn't that be more dignified than this slow rot? it feels like the only thing left to look forward to is just... stopping. like everything would finally be quiet.",
